<p>Buhh &#8212;buhh &#8212; mystery!</p>
<p>Additionally, as with most things I write about the Foundation, the motives of the unreliable narrators should be taken into account. The Foundation is pretending like it simply can't piece these three things together, when instead, it's pretending to not be putting the puzzle together until it knows where everything goes.</p>
